{
  "name": "Start",
  "comment": "A bare integer literal binds Type to {name:number, kind:int} — the int\nprimitive is no longer a top-level name; it surfaces as a kind of number.\nPins the architect's \"set %x% = 5 → {number, int}\" rule end-to-end.",
